%equation, giving an edge-solution corresponding to each edge $e \in E$.
%Then we set $A_V = \{x_1, \ldots , x_n\}$ and
%$A_E^i = \{ y_e^i : e \in E\}$ for each $i = 0 , 1 , \ldots , \ell-3$,
