The harness is on the demo rung. No oracle result has returned yet; this is normal because each call includes medium-effort reasoning and the harness waits for a complete response rather than counting provider errors as failures.
diff --git a/results/2502.08624/gen_2502_08624.py b/results/2502.08624/gen_2502_08624.py
